lavender: the stock voltage for the top Gold clocks through the array power mux (lv_cpu_volt=1 lv_cpu_volt_hi=1; default off; generator: xnu/src/mk_cpuvolthi.py)

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/LavenderMetrics.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/LavenderMetrics.cpp
